  <h1>About Chip &amp; Cell</h1>
  <p>
    Chip &amp; Cell offers focused coverage of Korea's two flagship export sectors —
    <a href="/semiconductor/">semiconductors</a> and <a href="/battery/">batteries</a>.
    Instead of covering the whole market thinly, we track a fixed universe of 27 KOSPI and
    KOSDAQ names in depth: the memory giants, the cell makers, and the equipment and
    materials ecosystem around them.
  </p>
  <h2>How the site works</h2>
  <p>
    An automated pipeline refreshes every stock's data page after each Seoul session close.
    Deep dives and weekly reviews combine that data with model-assisted analysis and are
    published under <a href="/posts/">Posts</a>. Details are on the
    <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>What this site is not</h2>
  <p>
    Chip &amp; Cell is a data and research site, not an advisory service. Nothing here is a
    recommendation to buy or sell any security. Figures may contain errors — always verify
    against primary sources before making decisions.
  </p>
</Base>
